{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767594,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Robo Soccer \u2014 Robot Football Arena","festival_id":null,"organization_id":627,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-22T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/robo-soccer-robot-football-arena-indraprastha-institute-of-information-technology-iiit-delhi-1767594","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Robo Soccer:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Robo Soccer is a competitive robotics event where participants control pre-built robots to play football in specially designed miniature soccer fields.<\/li>\n<li>The event is intended as a Next day activity after the rover-based event. The major advantage is that the club already has the robots, so participants do not need to build a robot from scratch. Instead, they will focus on robot control, coordination, strategy, navigation and competitive gameplay.<\/li>\n<li>The venue will contain 3 separate Robo Soccer fields so that multiple matches can take place simultaneously. This parallel-field setup will allow the event to accommodate 100+ participants within the planned 3-hour duration.<\/li>\n<li>Teams will participate in short football matches. Depending on the final number of participants and available robots, the competition can be organized into qualification\/group matches followed by knockout rounds.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Event Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expected participation: 100+ participants.<\/li>\n<li>Duration: 3 hours.<\/li>\n<li>3 parallel miniature soccer fields.<\/li>\n<li>Existing club robots will be used.<\/li>\n<li>Short matches to allow a large number of teams to participate.<\/li>\n<li>Match rules will define field boundaries, match duration, scoring, robot limits and penalties.<\/li>\n<li>Goodies will be given.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":""